You should also make sure you’ve looked through our checklist of all things before your download to prevent things from going wrong and protecting yourself in case they don’t. iOS 9 brings new features, including a much smarter personal assistant and huge new productivity features for the iPad, as well as changes that accelerate and repair the operating system.
