Hunting accident involving two injured at Pratau
Two tractor drivers have been seriously injured by gunfire during their corn harvest on Tuesday afternoon.
During harvesting on a corn field near Pratau (Wittenberg district), several hunters were deployed, as the police announced.
After a gunshot, a 63-year-old and a 22-year-old man suffered serious injuries and were taken to hospitals.
