Konrad’s reasons with his experience that, in contrast to the Ministry of the Interior, he is more successful in accommodation.
I am an elderly gentleman, to whom one does not easily tell the untruthiness.
Conviction is his most important weapon.
Konrad and Maier do not incur any costs to the Republic, as they themselves explained.
