Originally, this item had been on the non-public part of the agenda.
Under pressure from the project critics and the FDP faction, who accused the investor and administration of secrecy, Ralf Behrends went on the offensive from system construction management: "We don't have an answer to all questions yet," he said in front of the council members and more than 50 visitors.
But it's good to be able to face all the rumors now.
The approximately ten to twelve-million-euro project has been under discussion for months.
Violent reactions among sea stall owners who had come into the meeting evoked the pictures and new details about the desired hotel construction.
